      <page>33</page>
      <sourcename />
      <bonus />
      <firstlevelbonus />
      <naturalweapons />
      <notes>SPEED DEMON
COST: 3 KARMA
Pushing your vehicle to its limits makes the hair on the back of your neck stand up, but in a good way. You feel alive, alert, and ready to do anything. This increased intensity gives you a +1 dice pool bonus to Pilot tests for a vehicle that is moving at a speed attribute of 3 or higher (4 for aircraft). Note that your character must either be directly in the vehicle he is piloting or jacked in; the bonus does not apply to vehicles that are simply being piloted remotely.</notes>
      <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
    </quality>
