          <notes>GRID SUBSCRIPTION
Point Cost: 1 Type: Asset Monthly Nuyen Cost: 50¥ Minimum Lifestyle: Middle Nobody “downloads” or “records” their favorite song or movie any more. It’s all based on subscriptions and purchases within the Matrix and stored virtually on a grid.
Commlinks and home entertainment systems connect you wirelessly to everything from photos you’ve taken to corporate-sponsored lines of entertainment that you can watch whenever you want. Without a grid subscription, you might as well have a throwback commlink with an antique external storage device, as the public grid only has trid shows from like two seasons ago.</notes>
