      <location>a5ad6afb-e728-4f57-b455-7e4e0ea530ec</location>
      <notes>The medkit includes drug supplies, bandages, tools, and a (talkative) doctor expert system that can advise the user on techniques to handle most typical medical emergencies (including fractures, gunshot wounds, chemical wounds, and poisoning, as well as offering advice for the treating of shock, handling blood loss, and of course performing resuscitations). Add the medkit’s rating to your limit on First Aid tests. 

A medkit of Rating 3 or lower fitsin a pocket; at Rating 4+ it’s a handheld case. The medkit needs to be restocked after every (Rating) uses.

Wireless: The Medkit provides a dice pool bonus equal to its rating to First Aid + Logic tests, or can operate itself with a dice pool of Medkit Rating x 2 and a limit equal to its Rating.</notes>
      <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
      <discountedcost>False</discountedcost>
