      <children />
      <location>31ac392d-88e9-46ea-8b49-c160686830ce</location>
      <notes>A person’s face can be duplicated if you have a scan from a biometric reader (with the dice bonus on the Disguise Test equal to the biometric reader’s Rating). A Software + Logic Test (with the dice bonus on the Disguise Test equal to the successes) can replicate a speciic individual’s face or create a completely unique appearance. In either case, the limit on the test is equal to the Rating of the mask. The mask is reusable in the sense that it can be worn multiple times, but once an appearance has been set in either fashion described above, it cannot be altered.</notes>
      <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
      <discountedcost>False</discountedcost>
