      <notes>Vector: Injection
Speed: 1 Combat Turn
Penetration: 0
Power: 10
Effects: Paralysis
Often referred to as “Rock,” rocuronium is a powerful paralytic agent with a rapid onset. It has few side effects and can be quickly reversed using a specialized drug call Sugammadex, which reduces the remaining Power of the toxin by –2 every Combat Turn after injection.</notes>
