      <notes>Vector: Contact, Inhalation
Speed: 1 Combat Turn
Penetration: 0
Power: 15
Effect: Disorientation, Stun Damage
Neuro-Stun is colorless and odorless. It’s the industry standard knockout gas for emergency containment situations and comes in various concentrations. Neuro-Stun VIII becomes inert after ten minutes of contact with air;</notes>
